            ['title' => 'Where this calculation comes up', 'html' => <<<'TXT'
            <p>Use it whenever the numbers you have are Calculation based on, Start year and End year and the number you are missing is Inflation rate and Inflation rate.</p><p>Because nothing is stored between visits, the page is safe for one-off sums and for repeated ones — there is no history to clear and no account to keep.</p><p>Related work in the same category: <a href="/finance/real-gdp">Real GDP Calculator</a>, <a href="/finance/real-interest-rate">Real interest rate Calculator</a> and <a href="/finance/real-rate-of-return">Real rate of return Calculator</a>.</p>
